SecurityServiceImpl ..|> SecurityService
SecurityServiceImpl --> SecurityService
SecurityServiceImpl --> SecurityMapper
SecurityServiceImpl --> Security
App --> ParkingSpotDataTrans
ParkingSpotDataTrans --> SecurityService
ParkingSpotDataTrans --> UserSecurityInterceptor
ParkingSpotDataTrans --> InfrastructDeal
ParkingBasicDataSync ..|> InfrastructDeal
ParkingBasicDataSync --> ParkingBasicDataSyncResponse
ParkingBasicDataSync --> InfrastructDeal
